SMARTCLASS DEV

MASTER PROMPT: COMPLETE ONLINE CLASSROOM, SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT IDE, AND OFFLINE LEARNING PLATFORM

1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Act as a senior software architect, full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, database engineer, cybersecurity engineer, DevOps engineer, and real-time communication engineer.

Design and develop a complete, secure, scalable, modern educational technology platform named SmartClass Dev.

SmartClass Dev is an integrated online classroom and software development learning platform that enables students to continue learning after leaving physical school. Students must be able to attend live classes, study independently, communicate with teachers and classmates, research information, read digital books, write and execute programming code, build software projects, complete quizzes, track academic progress, and receive certificates.

The platform must support:

1. Web application.
2. Desktop application.
3. Android application.
4. iOS application.
5. Online learning.
6. Offline learning and offline coding for supported programming languages.
7. Real-time online classrooms.
8. Software development education.
9. Teacher and school administration.
10. Secure student management.

Build a real, functional application, not merely a static UI prototype.

All buttons, forms, menus, navigation items, counters, dashboards, and actions must be connected to their intended functionality. Do not use fake statistics or hardcoded sample data in production features.

Use realistic demo data only in explicitly identified development and testing environments.

